<title>USA: Janus group holds 10.4 pct UAL stake.</title>
<headline>Janus group holds 10.4 pct UAL stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Janus Capital Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Wednesday it holds a 10.4 percent stake in UAL Corp or 6,072,370 common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on UAL in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
